hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3008","Narrated to us Yaḥyā ibn Ḥabīb al-Ḥārithī: Narrated to us Ḥammād: From ʿAmr ibn Dīnār: From Ibn ʿUmar: From Bilāl (RA), that the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) prayed inside the Kaʿbah.\n\n---\nNarrated to us Aḥmad ibn ʿAbdah: Narrated to us Ḥammād: From ʿAmr ibn Dīnār: From Ibn ʿUmar: From Bilāl (RA), that the Prophet (ﷺ) prayed inside the Kaʿbah.\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
